specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/004-template-section-fill-guidance/plan.md:297:Phase 003 runs before this phase and converts every bare hint in `core/spec.md.tmpl` to a value token. T001 writes the token count to `scratch/baseline/locator-form.txt`. A count above `0` means the tree is post-003 and every repair below quotes the post-003 form. A count of `0` means phase 003 is not closed and the repair quotes the pre-token form. An anchor marker holds no hint, so its form is the same on both trees. `addons/research.md.tmpl` is outside the five templates phase 003 converts, so its repairs have one form on both trees.
specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/004-template-section-fill-guidance/plan.md:299:Each repair that quotes template text is written as a diff. A line that starts with `-` is removed and a line that starts with `+` is added. The leading `-` or `+` is not part of the template text. A quoted marker is written this way so that it does not read as an anchor of this plan.
