    75	## 2. PROBLEM & PURPOSE
    76	
    77	### Problem Statement
    78	A fresh Level 2 scaffold holds 97 bracketed hints and validates clean. A weak model leaves many of them in place, or replaces them with a sentence that restates the heading. The template says what field to fill but never what a good answer looks like. The 21 hand-written examples that a model imitates carry 14 anchor drifts and 18 leaked descriptions, so the model copies a skeleton the validator no longer expects.
    79	
    80	### Purpose
    81	Every section tells a weak model the one action to take and shows one good and one weak answer. The examples match the templates again, and two commands fail when either property breaks.
