    20	## EXECUTIVE SUMMARY
    21	
    22	This phase applies every ledger row whose `owner_phase` is `002`. Twenty-five rows are known now and written out literally in `tasks.md`. The rest come from the phase 1 census and were checked by the phase 1 frontier review. Exact text swaps are applied by a tested script, not by a model, so a weak executor cannot paraphrase them.
    23	
