   655	**When to Use:**
   656	- Stuck on same error after 3+ fix attempts
   657	- Complex multi-file debugging
   658	- Need fresh perspective on persistent issue
   659	- Architectural or logic-heavy debugging
   660	
   661	**Workflow:**
   662	
   663	```text
   664	1. TRIGGER
   665	   ├── Manual: Dispatch `@debug` via the Task tool
   666	   └── Auto-suggested: After repeated failures or frustration keywords
   667	
