council/changelog`                                               |\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-ai-council/changelog/v1.0.0.0.md:142:| `.opencode/agents/deep-ai-council.md`             | Created — `@deep-ai-council` definition, 19 numbered sections, scoped-write planning architect |\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-ai-council/changelog/v1.0.0.0.md:150:| `.opencode/skills/system-skill-advisor/mcp-server/lib/scorer/fusion.ts`                | Modified — explicit `deep-ai-council` council phrases bypass read-only guard     |\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-ai-council/changelog/v1.0.0.0.md:151:| `.opencode/skills/system-skill-advisor/mcp-server/tests/scorer/native-scorer.vitest.ts`| Modified — added council prompt regression case                                  |\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-ai-council/changelog/v1.0.0.0.md:169:If a downstream consumer still depends on the old runtime agent name, surface concrete evidence of the dependency before adding a compatibility shim — the project policy is to add shims only when a real consumer requires one.\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/graph-metadata.json:122:      \".opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/SKILL.md\",\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/graph-metadata.json:123:      \".opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/mode-registry.json\",\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/graph-metadata.json:124:      \".opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/SKILL.md\",\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/graph-metadata.json:125:      \".opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/SKILL.md\",\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/graph-metadata.json:126:      \".opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-ai-council/SKILL.md\",\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/graph-metadata.json:127:      \".opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-improvement/SKILL.md\",\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/graph-metadata.json:128:      \".opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-alignment/SKILL.md\",\n.opencode/skills/system-