 direct provider models such as `deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro`, `xiaomi/mimo-v2.5-pro`, or `openai/gpt-5.5-pro`; `--variant low/medium/high` where supported | Full plugin/skill/MCP runtime, direct-provider coverage, broad model bench within one CLI | Holistic, Research, or Creative |\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-ai-council/references/patterns/seat-diversity-patterns.md:101:- Analytical + `cli-opencode` (gpt-5.5 high): implementation sequence and codebase fit.\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-ai-council/references/patterns/seat-diversity-patterns.md:102:- Pragmatic + `cli-opencode` (gpt-5.5 medium): minimal working path and churn control.\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-ai-council/references/patterns/seat-diversity-patterns.md:103:- Holistic + `cli-opencode` (`deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro` high): system-wide impact, broad architectural fit via direct-provider model bench.\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-ai-council/references/patterns/seat-diversity-patterns.md:104:- Research + `cli-opencode` (multiple direct-provider models in one round): ecosystem context and external unknowns covered by multiple models within ONE CLI invocation.\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-ai-council/references/patterns/seat-diversity-patterns.md:134:Within ONE round, vantage diversity is achieved via DIFFERENT MODELS or REASONING LEVELS on the SAME CLI (e.g. on `cli-opencode`: `deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro --variant high` + `xiaomi/mimo-v2.5-pro`; on `cli-claude-code`: Opus + Haiku). Across-CLI diversity is staged as ADDITIONAL ROUNDS - each round runs on one CLI only.\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-ai-council/references/patterns/seat-diversity-patterns.md:232:    │       Optional Round 2: cli-opencode (gpt-5.5 high) for implementation-realism cross-check.\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-ai-council/references/patterns/seat-diversity-patterns.md:235:    │   └─► Round 1: cli-opencode (direct providers)\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-ai-coun