ok/manual-testing-playbook.md:48:- `review-mode-contract.yaml` exists at `.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/assets/`.\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md:56:- Cross-source consistency checks across README, SKILL.md, command, YAML, and runtime agent surfaces.\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md:64:- Execute steps in order so higher-level user-facing surfaces are checked before lower-level workflow contracts whenever that sequencing matters.\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md:84:2. The canonical prompt and command sequence were executed against the canonical deep-review surface.\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md:436:### DRV-033 | Review reducer surfaces blocked-stop history across registry, dashboard, and next-focus\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md:613:- `SKILL.md`: `.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/SKILL.md`\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md:614:- `README.md`: `.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/README.md`\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md:615:- `Command`: `.opencode/commands/deep/review.md`\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md:616:- `Auto YAML`: `.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-auto.yaml`\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md:617:- `Confirm YAML`: `.opencode/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-confirm.yaml`\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md:618:- `Agent (OpenCode)`: `.opencode/agents/deep-review.md`\n.open