upserts. Tests carry standard DRV- IDs since they live inside the deep-review release surface.\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md:789:Verify the reducer accumulates search-debt across iterations and surfaces it in the registry, dashboard, and final report.\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-alignment/feature-catalog/adapter-contract/adapter-sk-design.md:29:**Difference from deep-review:** deep-review audits general code/doc correctness with no notion of a Style Reference schema. sk-design-adapter audits a DESIGN.md against sk-design's *own* `design-md-format.md` structure and cardinal rules, and stays strictly static — it does not render or measure a live surface, which is exactly the boundary the separate live-render adapter exists to cross.\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-alignment/feature-catalog/adapter-contract/adapter-sk-design.md:42:| `.opencode/skills/sk-design/design-md-generator/references/design-md-format.md` | Standard source | The Style Reference schema and cardinal rules the structural layer checks against. |\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-alignment/manual-testing-playbook/verify-first-and-known-deviations/verify-first-no-finding-without-reprobe.md:48:1. `bash: node -e \"const d=require('./.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-alignment/scripts/adapters/sk-doc.cjs'); const c=require('./.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-alignment/scripts/adapters/sk-code.cjs'); console.log('sk-doc reality (no claims):', d.check('.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-alignment/references/discover-contract.md', {knownDeviations:[]}, {}).filter(f=>f.subcheck==='reality-alignment').length); console.log('sk-code reasoning (no findings):', c.check('.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-alignment/scripts/scoping.cjs', {knownDeviations:[]}, {verifiedFindings:[{dimension:'naming',matchesStandard:false}]}).filter(f=>f.layer==='reasoning-agent').length);\"`\n.opencode/skills/system-deep-lo