st):** n=3 is thin, so MiMo's true failure rate is uncertain (1 event). 3 of 4 fixtures saturated (both models 1.0) — the harness flags `promote-or-demote-to-smoke`; a sharper verdict needs harder fixtures + more samples. But the instrument worked: the hard-fixture pack surfaced a reliability gap the old 2-fixture (always-saturated) benchmark could never show.\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-models/benchmarks/2026-07-10--prompt-framework--minimax/eval-loop/variants/v-002-race.md:11:# RACE dispatch: {{fixture.id}}\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-models/benchmarks/2026-06-01--prompt-framework--mimo/eval/runs/rcaf--chunk.M3-FAILED-empty-exit0.json:9:  \"dispatched_at\": \"2026-06-02T05:35:34.670Z\",\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-models/benchmarks/2026-07-10--prompt-framework--minimax/eval-loop/variants/v-004-tidd-ec.md:11:# TIDD-EC dispatch: {{fixture.id}}\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-models/benchmarks/2026-07-10--eval-loop--swe-1-6/scripts/dispatch-swe16.cjs:3: * scripts/dispatch-swe16.cjs\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-models/benchmarks/2026-07-10--eval-loop--swe-1-6/scripts/dispatch-swe16.cjs:5: * Wraps a single cli-devin dispatch against Devin's SWE 1.6 model. Handles:\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-models/benchmarks/2026-07-10--eval-loop--swe-1-6/scripts/dispatch-swe16.cjs:15: *   node scripts/dispatch-swe16.cjs <prompt-file>          Real dispatch.\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-models/benchmarks/2026-07-10--eval-loop--swe-1-6/scripts/dispatch-swe16.cjs:16: *   node scripts/dispatch-swe16.cjs --mock <prompt-file>   Mock dispatch\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-models/benchmarks/2026-07-10--eval-loop--swe-1-6/scripts/dispatch-swe16.cjs:63:function dispatchReal(promptFile, opts) {\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/prompt-models/benchmarks/2026-07-10--eval-loop--swe-1-6/scripts/dispatch-swe16.cjs:98:        process.stderr.write(`dispatch-swe16: rate limit on attempt ${attempt + 1}; backing off ${wait}ms\\n`);\n.opencode/skills/sk-prompt/pro