    67	## 3. SCOPE
    68	
    69	### In Scope
    70	- User registration with email and password
    71	- User login with session management
    72	- Password hashing using bcrypt
    73	- JWT token generation and validation
    74	- Input validation with clear error messages
    75	- Protection against common attacks (SQL injection, timing attacks)
    76	- Database schema for user storage
    77	- Auth middleware for protected routes
    78	- Compliance documentation
    79	- Security review sign-off
    80	
    81	### Out of Scope
    82	- Social login (OAuth) - spec/013-oauth-integration
    83	- Password reset functionality - spec/014-password-reset
    84	- Two-factor authentication - future enhancement
    85	- Role-based permissions - spec/015-rbac
    86	- Email verification - requires email service
    87	
    88	### Files to Change
    89	
    90	| File Path | Change Type | Description |
    91	|-----------|-------------|-------------|
    92	| src/auth/register.js | Create | Registration form and API handler |
    93	| src/auth/login.js | Create | Login form and session creation |
    94	| src/auth/logout.js | Create | Session termination |
    95	| src/utils/hash.js | Create | Password hashing utilities |
    96	| src/utils/token.js | Create | JWT generation and validation |
    97	| src/middleware/auth.js | Create | Authentication middleware |
    98	| src/validators/auth.js | Create | Input validation schemas |
    99	| prisma/schema.prisma | Modify | Add User model |
   100	| tests/ | Create | Unit and integration tests |
   101	
