     1	---
     2	title: "Packet Changelog Templates"
     3	description: "Packet-local changelog templates for root specs and phase child folders."
     4	trigger_phrases:
     5	  - "packet changelog templates"
     6	  - "nested changelog templates"
     7	  - "root phase changelog"
     8	---
     9	
    10	# Packet Changelog Templates
    11	
    12	---
    13	
    14	## 1. OVERVIEW
    15	
    16	`templates/changelog/` contains packet-local changelog templates generated inside spec folders. These templates summarize canonical packet docs and are separate from global release-note templates under `.skilled/changelog/`.
    17	
    18	Current state:
    19	
    20	- `root.md` renders changelogs for root spec folders.
    21	- `phase.md` renders changelogs for phase child folders.
    22	- Recovery flows through `/speckit:resume`, implemented by `.skilled/commands/speckit/resume.md`, and canonical continuity docs.
    23	
    24	---
    25	
    26	## 2. DIRECTORY TREE
    27	
    28	```text
    29	changelog/
    30	├── README.md
    31	├── root.md    # Root packet changelog template
    32	└── phase.md   # Phase child changelog template
    33	```
    34	
    35	---
    36	
    37	## 3. KEY FILES
    38	
    39	| File | Role |
    40	|---|---|
    41	| `root.md` | Template for `changelog/changelog-<packet>-root.md`. |
    42	| `phase.md` | Template for phase child changelogs in the parent packet `changelog/` folder. |
    43	
    44	---
    45	
    46	## 4. BOUNDARIES AND FLOW
    47	
    48	Boundaries:
    49	
    50	- This directory owns packet-local changelog templates only.
    51	- It must not replace global release-note templates.
    52	- Generated changelogs summarize packet docs, not live worktree diffs.
    53	
    54	Generation flow:
    55	
    56	```text
    57	╭────────────────────╮
    58	│ canonical spec docs│
    59	╰─────────┬──────────╯
    60	          ▼
    61	┌────────────────────┐
    62	│ root.md or phase.md│
    63	└─────────┬──────────┘
    64	          ▼
    65	┌────────────────────┐
    66	│ changelog generator│
    67	└─────────┬──────────┘
    68	          ▼
    69	┌────────────────────┐
    70	│ packet changelog   │
    71	└────────────────────┘
    72	```
    73	
    74	---
    75	
    76	## 5. ENTRYPOINTS
    77	
    78	| Entrypoint | Use |
    79	|---|---|
    80	| `root.md` | Root spec folder changelog generation. |
    81	| `phase.md` | Phase child changelog generation. |
    82	| Changelog generator script | Reads canonical packet docs and applies one template. |
    83	
    84	---
    85	
    86	## 6. VALIDATION
    87	
    88	Run from the repository root after template edits:
    89	
    90	```bash
    91	bash .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/validate.sh <spec-folder> --strict
    92	```
    93	
    94	Generated changelogs should reference available packet docs and avoid claiming task completion beyond those docs.
    95	
    96	---
    97	
    98	## 7. RELATED
    99	
   100	| Document | Role |
   101	|---|---|
   102	| [sk-doc changelog template](../../../sk-doc/sk-create-changelog/assets/changelog-template.md) | Global changelog and release-note template. |

