    49	## Phase Context
    50	
    51	This is **Phase 2** of the Make system-spec-kit templates and authoring docs followable by a DeepSeek V4.1 Flash agent swarm specification.
    52	
    53	**Scope Boundary**: the files named by ledger rows with `owner_phase` `002`, all under `.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/`. No template under `templates/core/`, `templates/addons/` or `templates/packet-types/` changes in this phase, because phases 3 and 4 own them.
    54	
    55	**Dependencies**:
    56	- `../001-template-drift-census-and-baseline/scratch/ledger/ledger.jsonl`, reviewed.
    57	- `../001-template-drift-census-and-baseline/scratch/baseline/suite-start.txt`.
    58	- The launch preconditions in `../spec.md` section 3, recorded as met in `../goal.md` section 4. The build worktree path there becomes `WORKTREE` in `tasks.md`.
    59	
    60	**Deliverables**:
    61	- The fixed files.
    62	- `scratch/ledger/known-rows.jsonl`: the 25 known rows.
    63	- `scratch/tools/apply_row.py` and `scratch/tools/lib.sh`: the exact-match applier and its helper functions.
    64	- `scratch/applied.txt`: an `APPLIED` line, a `CHECK` line and a `KCHECK` line for each of the 25 known rows.
    65	- `scratch/census.txt`: one line per owner `002` ledger row with its result.
    66	- One local commit for the phase.
    67	
    68	**Changelog**:
    69	- When this phase closes, refresh the matching file in ../changelog/ using the parent packet number plus this phase folder name.
    70	<!-- /ANCHOR:phase-context -->
