    74	<!-- ANCHOR:problem -->
    75	## 2. PROBLEM & PURPOSE
    76	
    77	### Problem Statement
    78	The example docs a model imitates carry broken descriptions in 18 of 21 files, three of them still cite a `Checklist.md` that no longer exists. Two authoring lines tell a reader to open a literal `<spec-folder>`. The style guide says both "table" and "bulleted list" for the same metadata. A weak model copies these exactly.
    79	
    80	### Purpose
    81	Every defect the census assigned to this phase is gone, proved by its own evidence command no longer reproducing.
    82	<!-- /ANCHOR:problem -->
