   145	## 6. RISKS & DEPENDENCIES
   146	
   147	| Type | Item | Impact | Mitigation |
   148	|------|------|--------|------------|
   149	| Dependency | bcrypt library | Cannot hash passwords | Use native crypto as fallback |
   150	| Dependency | jsonwebtoken | Cannot generate sessions | Session-based auth fallback |
   151	| Dependency | Database connection | Cannot store users | Validate DB connection at startup |
   152	| Risk | Token security | Session hijacking | HttpOnly cookies in Phase 2 |
   153	| Risk | Timing attacks | Email enumeration | Constant-time comparison |
