    42	| AC-002 | REQ-002 | Given a registered user, When they submit valid credentials, Then a token is issued and they land on the dashboard | `tests/auth/login.test.ts:31` | Met | - |
    43	| AC-003 | REQ-003 | Given a registration request, When the password is persisted, Then only a bcrypt hash of 10 rounds is stored | `tests/auth/hash.test.ts:12` | Met | - |
    44	| AC-004 | REQ-004 | Given malformed input, When the form is submitted, Then the email format and the 8-character minimum are enforced | `tests/auth/validation.test.ts:18` | Met | - |
