   545	## 5. SUCCESS CRITERIA
   546	
   547	Success means the selected spec folder uses the right template set, placeholders and sample content are removed, links between packet docs work, continuity is saved or updated, Level 2+ `tasks.md` P0/P1 checklist items are verified with evidence, every `acceptance-criteria.md` criterion is `Met`, `Waived` or `Superseded`, and `validate.sh --strict` has no blocking errors.
   548	
   549	---
   550	
   551	## 6. INTEGRATION POINTS
   552	
   553	P0 blocks, P1 requires completion or approved deferral, and P2 is optional. Code updates route through `sk-code`; documentation updates route through `sk-doc`; git handoff routes through `sk-git`.
   554	
   555	### Quick Reference Commands
   556	
   557	| Command | Usage |
   558	| --- | --- |
   559	| Canonical intake | `/speckit:plan --intake-only "Description"` |
   560	| Create spec folder | `./runtime/cli/spec/create.sh "Description" --short-name name --level 2` |
   561	| Create in a track | Add `--track <track>` to the create command. The new packet is also listed in `specs/<track>/graph-metadata.json` |
   562	| Track-root lists | `node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/refresh-track-roots.mjs --apply` after moving, renaming or deleting a packet in a track by hand; `archive.sh` refreshes it itself. The pre-push hook blocks a commit whose track lists other packets than it holds |
   563	| Validate | `.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/validate.sh specs/007-feature/` |
   564	| Verify code alignment drift | `python3 .skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-skilled/assets/scripts/verify_alignment_drift.py --root .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit` |
   565	| Save context | `node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/dist/continuity/generate-context.js /tmp/save-context-data-<session-id>.json specs/007-feature/` |
   566	| Gate 1 trigger lookup | `node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/retrieval/lookup-trigger-index.mjs --json -- "<prompt>"` (exit `0` hit, `1` no-hit, `2` broken) |
   567	| Regenerate trigger index | `node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/retrieval/generate-trigger-index.mjs` |
   568	| Free-text retrieval | The ripgrep recipes in `references/retrieval/retrieval-conventions.md` §2, scoped by the trailing positional path |
   569	| Next spec number | `ls -d specs/[0-9]*/ \| sed 's/.*\/\([0-9]*\)-.*/\1/' \| sort -n \| tail -1` |
   570	| Upgrade level | `bash .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/upgrade-level.sh specs/007-feature/ --to 2` |
