   266	\## 3. IMPLEMENTATION
   267	```
   268	
   269	**Rules:**
   270	- Keep numbering sequential (1, 2, 3, ...)
   271	- Never remove emojis (they provide visual scanning cues)
   272	- Use ALL CAPS for section titles
