specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/001-template-drift-census-and-baseline/spec.md:22:This phase changes no system-spec-kit file. It produces two things every later phase depends on: a ledger with one row per defect, each row carrying the exact replacement text and a command that reproduces the defect, and a baseline of how a DeepSeek V4.1 Flash worker authors a Level 2 packet today. Phases 2 to 7 fix ledger rows. Phase 9 reruns the baseline and reports the change.
