specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/009-authoring-benchmark-and-closeout/spec.md:22:Phase 1 measured how a DeepSeek V4.1 Flash worker authored a Level 2 packet before any template changed. This phase measures the same task the same way on the final tree and reports the difference for five metrics, each as a minimum and a maximum over three runs. It then publishes the benchmark report, writes the changelogs, regenerates the trigger index, refreshes the track roots and closes the packet against the seven criteria in `../goal.md` section 3.
