   117	| `.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/card-sync.vitest.ts` | Create | Runs the guard in the suite |
   118	| `specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/005-weak-model-authoring-card/scratch/card-bench/*` and `.../scratch/runs/*` | Create | Three smoke replies and their metrics |
