    90	## 4. WHAT IT REPAIRS
    91	
    92	| Failure | Recomputed from |
    93	|---------|-----------------|
    94	| Recorded folder name in the summary | The packet's own directory name |
    95	| Packet pointer in document frontmatter | The packet's path beneath the specs root |
    96	| `specFolder` in the generated description | The packet's path beneath the specs root |
    97	| Graph parent of a packet sitting directly in an archive | None, since `z_archive` is not a packet |
    98	| Missing level in the generated description | The level the validator detects |
    99	| Stale generated-metadata fingerprint | A re-derive over the packet's current sources |
